# CI contract hygiene

Lessons from the 2026-10-01 main CI unblock:
[`docs/audit/session-knowledge-2026-10-01-ci-unblock.md`](../../docs/audit/session-knowledge-2026-10-01-ci-unblock.md).

Before merging changes in the globs above, run the matching local gates — do not wait for GitHub.

## Migrations / journal

- Ship SQL + `meta/_journal.json` + generated shape together (`npm run db:check`).
- The unit contract derives the expected journal **tail from the shipped SQL files** — do not hardcode a stale `idx`/`tag` in `db-deploy.test.ts`.
- When health / host-readiness **fixtures** embed a `tailTag` / `tailIdx`, those values are mock data only; keep them consistent within the fixture, not necessarily equal to production’s latest migration.

## Public paths ↔ content review

- Adding a path to [`SHELL_PATHS` / `PUBLIC_PATHS`](../../src/app/sitemap.ts) also requires an entry in [`content-review-catalog.ts`](../../src/lib/ops/content-review-catalog.ts) (`SITE_SHELL_PATHS` or the derived section).
- Guard: `npm run test:unit -- src/lib/ops/content-review-catalog.test.ts`.

## HealthStatus / typecheck fixtures

- New **required** fields on `HealthStatus` must be set in every `baseHealth()` / fixture helper (`host-readiness*.test.ts`, `deploy-notify.test.ts`, etc.). `Partial<HealthStatus>` overrides alone do not satisfy a required property that the base object omits.
- Env stubs in tests: prefer `as unknown as NodeJS.ProcessEnv` when the object is not a full `ProcessEnv`.

## Audit log writes

- Use `metadata: Record<string, string>` on `auditLog.log`. There is no `details` field. Coerce booleans/`null` with `String(...)` / `?? ""`.

## Brand admin + axe / e2e

- Colour **picker + hex** pairs: both inputs need an accessible name (label/`htmlFor` on hex, `aria-labelledby` on the picker). Whole-page axe on Site Admin will fail unlabeled hex fields.
- If the same component mounts twice on one page (e.g. host + union lookbooks), smoke locators must be **scoped** (`locator('#brand-style-panel-…')` / `getByTestId` under a unique ancestor) — never bare `getByTestId('brand-lookbook')` on that page.
- Brand Kit union/sector selects: wait for hydration with `toPass` (store rewrites localStorage presets). Prefer ≥20s visible + ≥30s `toPass` for preset races already seen as flaky in CI.

## Minimum local commands

```bash
npm run typecheck
npm run test:unit -- src/lib/db/db-deploy.test.ts src/lib/ops/content-review-catalog.test.ts
# when UI/routes or e2e specs change:
npm run test:smoke -- e2e/brand-lookbook.smoke.spec.ts
```
